[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="BiomeProfile" format=3]
; Layer 4, the core: what the machines call paradise. Ancient machinery, older than the foundry: warm grey stone, dark bronze
; and black iron in a dim maroon murk; the decor accent is ember red, the glow of the heart they descend toward
; (docs/art-direction.md#look: the palette warms with depth, to dark amber and ember at the core). Heat stays in the molten
; ember-gold, apart from the red, the only saturated marks on the play plane.

